WEBVTT

00:00:28.966 --> 00:00:32.223
we had the obit for the inventor
of the sock puppet.

00:00:32.671 --> 00:00:33.974
(Laughter)

00:00:33.998 --> 00:00:35.879
Everyone knows what a sock puppet is,

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:38.101
but have you ever thought
about who created it,

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.775
or what their life was like?

00:00:40.522 --> 00:00:42.783
Obits are a signature form of journalism.

00:00:42.807 --> 00:00:44.379
An art form, if you will.

00:00:44.403 --> 00:00:48.093
It's an opportunity for a writer
to weave the tale of a person's life

00:00:48.117 --> 00:00:49.917
into a beautiful narrative.

00:00:51.038 --> 00:00:53.006
Since 1851,

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.468
the "New York Times"
has published thousands of obituaries.

00:00:57.159 --> 00:01:00.643
For heads of state, famous celebrities,